      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not opposed to changing the name.\n\nTo me, SetClearLineOnEnter reads more ambiguous, like you get a clear (as in clean/fresh) prompt line when you press enter, which is already true in either case?\n\nThe contrapositive could be clearer, though it opposes the default: SetEchoInputLine or something?\n\nI tried a bunch of variations, ultimately felt most comfortable with SetEnterClear. Those were the keywords I was searching for when I was looking for this API, so it seemed like a good entry-point.\n\nI\u0027m happy to modify into whatever decision you\u0027d like, though. Want to go with SetClearLineOnEnter?",
